@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Sprint 01 - Proposed Setup Goal and Evidence Cycle
start
:Planning: refine setup issue, prerequisites and exact criteria;
:Confirm selected goal/work before marking execution started;
:Execute separately authorized isolated setup;
:Record actual revision, commands and S01 checks;
:Review demonstrated outcome against goal;
if (Required setup evidence sufficient?) then (yes)
 :Record verified scope only;
else (no / not executed)
 :Record unmet checks, blocker and follow-up;
endif
:Retrospective: inspect actual process observations;
:Select one concrete improvement and success signal;
:Carry work and improvement into next planning record;
stop
@enduml
